    "text": "<p>Moment of inertia of point mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>Perpendicular</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>distance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>from</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>axis</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/73e0535d-bd94-41a1-ad80-de736993e02e-image.png\" style=\"width: 241px; height: 245px;\" /></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">Moment of Inertia&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>l</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>l</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>l</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
